          "id": "555086d566a99584a5e2b1c1a7db657c6e310270",
          "title": "認識 Factory Droid 1.0：一個建立在腳本模式上的模型無關編碼代理程式骨架 / Meet Factory Droid 1.0: A Model-Independent Coding Agent Harness Built on Script Mode",
          "title_zh": "認識 Factory Droid 1.0：一個建立在腳本模式上的模型無關編碼代理程式骨架",
          "title_en": "Meet Factory Droid 1.0: A Model-Independent Coding Agent Harness Built on Script Mode",
          "title_original": "Meet Factory Droid 1.0: A Model-Independent Coding Agent Harness Built on Script Mode",
          "summary": "Factory released Droid 1.0, a model-independent coding agent harness that makes programmatic tool calling the default. On Factory’s own Terminal-Bench 4 runs, Droid scores 65.2% with Claude Opus 5.5 at $4.73 per passed task. The post Meet Factory Droid 1.0: A Model-Independent Coding Agent Harness Built on Script Mode appeared first on MarkTechPost .",
          "summary_zh": "Factory 發布了 Droid 1.0，這是一個模型無關的編碼代理程式骨架，能將程式化工具呼叫設為預設值。在 Factory 自身的 Terminal-Bench 4 執行測試中，Droid 以 Claude Opus 5.5 獲得 65.2% 的分數，每個通過的任務成本為 4.73 美元。",
